+## S13 opt-in child TT prefetch — 2026-10-26
+
+The isolated `FORGE_S13_TT_CHILD_PREFETCH` build switch and `TtChildPrefetch` UCI option both default OFF. ON adds prefetch after null-move and ProbCut make, while retaining the original qsearch/main prefetches and existing 64-byte TT-cluster assertion. It snapshots the requested atomic option before helper launch and announces `info string TtChildPrefetch active` once. Set the option before searching. No TT layout, move order, evaluation value or network changes. Native node parity, sanitizer checks and speed remain UNVERIFIED until the separate qualification completes; no strength claim.
 
 Status: **UNPROVEN. No Elo or strength claim.** Built on the box by Engine Coder, 2026-10-23.
 
